WEBVTT

NOTE Re-timed to Piper narration (en_US-ljspeech-high, LJ Speech (Keith Ito), public domain). Native review still required.

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.258
Open the verified Setup package on your PC. Confirm that your console
firmware and prerequisite environment are listed for this release. If not,

2
00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:15.195
stop and ask the maintainers; do not update firmware as a guess.

3
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:40.065
Put the PC and console on your trusted home network. Choose Find your PS5 or
enter its address. Confirm the device, then review every check before

4
00:00:40.065 --> 00:00:44.858
continuing. Resolve blocked checks and keep their support codes.

5
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:10.372
Choose the apps you want. Bloom Core is required while other suite apps are
installed. JDownloader 2 is optional and separate: review its installer and

6
00:01:10.372 --> 00:01:16.332
terms. Start installation and wait for the final results, not just a
progress bar.

7
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:40.510
For a newer release choose Update in Installed apps. For missing application
files choose Repair. Preserve user data and backups. If installation stops,

8
00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:47.168
review completed steps before retrying; a partial transfer is not a
successful installation.

9
00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:10.371
Read the release notes and compatibility matrix first. Unknown means
untested, not supported. Ex-Box 360 is planned for later. Mock screenshots

10
00:02:10.371 --> 00:02:15.113
show the intended interface, not verified console behaviour.
